*
!.gitignore
# package.json is tracked so extension deps that pi does NOT install for us are
# reproducible on a fresh machine. pi manages the `packages` entries from
# settings.json itself; @earendil-works/pi-tui is a plain library import used by
# lazy-tools / lazy-skills, and pi deadlocks silently without it — see
# ~/.agents/docs/pi-context-budget.md ("Traps").
!package.json
